# Cursor Rule — Product

Before building user-facing features, read `docs/PRODUCT.md`.

- Do not invent product requirements. If absent, ask.
- Prefer the smallest change that satisfies the user need.
- If a feature contradicts the product definition, flag it and ask.
- Product changes require a change request and an update to `docs/PRODUCT.md`.
